sequenceDiagram
    participant V as view.js / undo.js (phone)
    participant A as web/api.py
    participant K as RecipeKeeper
    participant R as SqliteRecipeRepository
    V->>A: DELETE /api/recipes/7
    A->>K: delete(7)
    K->>R: mark_deleted(7, now)
    Note over R: same transaction purges every other pending delete (it becomes final)
    A-->>V: 200 {id: 7, title, undo_seconds: 10}
    Note over V: sessionStorage {id, title, until}, go to list, bar "'Lemon Cake' deleted · Undo" survives page changes
    alt Undo tapped within the window
        V->>A: POST /api/recipes/7/restore
        A->>K: restore(7)
        K->>K: now <= deleted_at + 10 s + 2 s grace?
        K->>R: unmark_deleted(7, free_title(title, live keys))
        A-->>V: 200 {id, title, renamed_to}
    else too late (or browser closed)
        V->>A: POST /api/recipes/7/restore
        A-->>V: 410 undo_expired
        Note over K,R: recipe stays hidden from list and search, purged on next list or delete
    end
